# Experiment layout

Static site. GitHub Pages serves `main` at `https://ironslob.github.io/webxr-experiments/`. Use relative URLs so the same files work from a local server at the repo root.

- `index.html` lists every experiment and links to its folder.
- Each experiment is its own folder: `experiments/<name>/`.
- `index.html` in that folder is the landing page only. Describe the scene, show the settings that change how it runs, and include a Launch button. Do not start WebGL here.
- Launch opens `play.html` in the same folder and passes the chosen settings as query parameters. `main.js` reads those parameters and applies them. Opening `play.html` with no query uses the same defaults as the form.
- Add a new experiment by creating the folder, landing page, and play page, then adding a card on the root index.

```
experiments/walls/
  index.html   landing page, settings, Launch
  play.html    the session
  main.js      reads ?surfaces=walls&opacity=0.45&scan=1
```
